u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u000f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u000f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u000f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0010\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0010\u0000\u0000\u0000\u000f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u000f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u000f\u0000\u0000\u0000[\u0000\u0001\u0000\u001f\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0014\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0014\u0000\u0000\u0000\u00f6\u00ff\u00a9\u0000\u00ab\u0001Fast, agile and just entering production, the NeoTech NWM-1N is "
    },
    {
      "type": "ascii",
      "start": 751,
      "end": 1114,
      "text": "the first mech produced by NeoTech, Inc, a Clan Wolf in Exile company.\r\n\r\nThe NeoWolf is designed as a multi-role mech.  With the Active Probe and the TAG unit, it can seek out shutdown mechs and equipment and call down a rain of fire upon them.   The ER-PPC gives it Sniper ability, while the claw and the Medium Pulse Laser allow it to get close and brawl.   \r\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "len_string",
      "start": 1114,
      "end": 2013,
      "length": 897,
      "text": "This Variant of the Neo Wolf uses a prototype weapon for its primary.  Called the High Velocity Assaut Rifle, this weapon, developed in house at NeoTech Industries, is a highly modified Gauss Rifle, firing a single slug at enormous distances, making it very well suited for the sniper role.  Coupled with a targeting system, and an ECM to prevent the Mech from being easily spotted or targeted while it is sniping, this makes a very effective support mech.\r\n\r\nThere are some drawbacks though.  The weight of this weapon is enough where very little else was able to be put in the Neo Wolf.  It only carries a rear mounted ER Micro Laser and an ER Medium Laser, making this mech a little more vulnerable at close ranges.   Another drawback is it still has the limitation of very few shots per ton, even less now, at 5 per ton, so proximity to an ammo supply is needed for any drawn out engagements. "
    },
    {
      "type": "len_string",
      "start": 2013,
      "end": 2159,
      "length": 144,
      "text": "No battle history so far for this mech.  Trials are doing well with the Wolves in Exile and the FC.  Primarily used as a sniper with both groups"
    },
